              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mn ∞
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo →
                    %mi V
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R} ^{(\infty )} \to V
              carefully as follows. Pick a non-zero vector
              = succeed "." do
